{% comment %}
  Runs inside al-folio's bib layout before the venue line is assembled. It appends a
  display-only imprint to the journal name, such as "Scientific Reports (Nature Portfolio)",
  so the BibTeX journal field stays as the version of record.
{% endcomment %}
{% if entry.imprint %}
  {% capture entrytype %}{{ entrytype }} ({{ entry.imprint }}){% endcapture %}
{% endif %}
